==================================================
13. N8N WORKFLOW BEHAVIOUR
==================================================

The primary workflow should:

1. Receive a webhook request.
2. Verify the secret/signature.
3. Validate required fields.
4. Retrieve the approved post.
5. Confirm the post is still approved.
6. Retrieve media securely.
7. Prepare platform-specific payloads.
8. Publish to every selected platform.
9. Capture the response for each platform.
10. Update the dashboard through a callback webhook.
11. Write reporting information to MySQL or Google Sheets.
12. Send success/failure notifications.
13. Return an execution ID immediately for long-running jobs.

Use one parent orchestration workflow and separate sub-workflows for:
- LinkedIn publishing
- Facebook publishing
- Instagram publishing
- X publishing
- Email approval
- Google Sheets synchronization
- Reporting
- Failure notification

A failure on one platform must not erase successful results from other platforms. Save per-platform results.

